 TestHouseKeepingWhenBusy←{
     ⍝ House keeping must run even when the server is never idle for a whole CongaTimeout.
     ⍝ The test server runs with a CongaTimeout of one second; asking it something every
     ⍝ 300 milliseconds means Conga never times out, so before 3.4.2 the count stood still.
     n0←AskHouseKeepingCount 0
     _←{
         _←AskHouseKeepingCount 0
         ⎕DL 0.3
     }¨⍳15
     n1←AskHouseKeepingCount 0
     2>n1-n0:1
     0
 }
